    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/1990b788814055fcd6b76798d5594a42.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Lio was just a regular college student, until one day he found himself in a twisted alternative reality without any memories.<br>Break the fourth wall and collaborate with him to find out his story.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/d78072802678d9577541fe1a9a13762d.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>With almost 2 years of active development on his back, &quot;LIO&quot; aims to stand out as unique experience by using multiple artstyles and forms of gameplay.<br>Play and solve riddles across full 3D and isometric-2D sequences, all while uncovering Lio's story across 2D-pixel art and 3D cutscenes.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/8881e19b8c0fb7c3523d038cd0669916.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Along with multiple ways of exploring the videogame medium, &quot;LIO&quot; also puts together the work of 11 different musical and SFX artists, while also featuring 3 vocal perfomances. <br>The soundtrack will surely get you caught in a unique atmosphere.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/a3a6cb5421de9e5959c1d0c0ce858899.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Reaching &quot;the end&quot; means nothing, or pehaps it does?<br>With two main endings and 3 small sub-endings, those with an high enough attention span will be able to play from 3 to 6 hours before the full story is unravelled. (Not including the easter eggs... hehehehe).<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/c82b03aeefd69721e559b84da4cb1800.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>&quot;LIO&quot; is a completely free game developed by a single person with the only intent of sharing passion for this incredible entertainment medium we all love and to celebrate creative endeavor without caring too much about nowadays standards.<br>It's simple, very authorial and without too many premises, but i still hope you'll love it as much as i do!<br><br><i>Created by Fili - In loving memory and dedicated to S.B. (1968 - 2022)</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/1990b788814055fcd6b76798d5594a42.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Lio was just a regular college student, until one day he found himself in a twisted alternative reality without any memories.<br>Break the fourth wall and collaborate with him to find out his story.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/d78072802678d9577541fe1a9a13762d.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>With almost 2 years of active development on his back, &quot;LIO&quot; aims to stand out as unique experience by using multiple artstyles and forms of gameplay.<br>Play and solve riddles across full 3D and isometric-2D sequences, all while uncovering Lio's story across 2D-pixel art and 3D cutscenes.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/8881e19b8c0fb7c3523d038cd0669916.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Along with multiple ways of exploring the videogame medium, &quot;LIO&quot; also puts together the work of 11 different musical and SFX artists, while also featuring 3 vocal perfomances. <br>The soundtrack will surely get you caught in a unique atmosphere.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/a3a6cb5421de9e5959c1d0c0ce858899.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Reaching &quot;the end&quot; means nothing, or pehaps it does?<br>With two main endings and 3 small sub-endings, those with an high enough attention span will be able to play from 3 to 6 hours before the full story is unravelled. (Not including the easter eggs... hehehehe).<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749930/extras/c82b03aeefd69721e559b84da4cb1800.avif?t=1727735214\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>&quot;LIO&quot; is a completely free game developed by a single person with the only intent of sharing passion for this incredible entertainment medium we all love and to celebrate creative endeavor without caring too much about nowadays standards.<br>It's simple, very authorial and without too many premises, but i still hope you'll love it as much as i do!<br><br><i>Created by Fili - In loving memory and dedicated to S.B. (1968 - 2022)</i>",
